OL,3,AJust how hot and dry was your summer?
OL,4,AUse our postcode lookup to find out
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe UK faced its hottest summer on
OL,7,Frecord this year, with much of the
OL,8,Fcountry experiencing drought and
OL,9,Frepeated heatwaves.
OL,11,FBut temperatures and rainfall were not
OL,12,Fthe same everywhere. Type in your
OL,13,Fpostcode to see what summer 2026 was
OL,14,Flike in your area.
OL,16,FHigh-pressure weather systems sat over
OL,17,Fthe UK for much of the summer, bringing
OL,18,Fclear, sunny skies for many parts of
OL,19,Fthe country and creating warm, dry
OL,20,Fconditions.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
